">dil</span><span begin="23.266" end="23.618">vo</span><span begin="23.618" end="24.368">sne</span></text><text for="L6"><span begin="24.714" end="24.998">Stal</span><span begin="24.998" end="25.352">ras</span><span begin="25.352" end="25.696">tvo</span><span begin="25.696" end="26.026">yat&apos;</span><span begin="26.026" end="26.334">sya</span><span begin="26.334" end="26.724">v bez</span><span begin="26.724" end="27.354">don</span><span begin="27.354" end="27.698">noj</span><span begin="27.698" end="28.478">t&apos;me</span></text><text for="L7"><span begin="28.786" end="29.072">Po</span><span begin="29.072" end="29.402">to</span><span begin="29.402" end="29.762">ki</span><span begin="29.762" end="30.084">bud</span><span begin="30.084" end="30.436">nich</span><span begin="30.436" end="30.788">noj</span><span begin="30.788" end="31.442">su</span><span begin="31.442" end="31.772">e</span><span begin="31.772" end="32.522">ty`</span></text><text for="L8"><span begin="32.904" end="33.174">U</span><span begin="33.174" end="33.496">nes</span><span begin="33.496" end="33.864">li</span><span begin="33.864" end="34.194">mi</span><span begin="34.194" end="34.538">ly`</span><span begin="34.538" end="34.928">e</span><span begin="34.928" end="35.574">mne</span><span begin="35.574" end="35.912">cher</span><span begin="35.912" end="36.602">ty`</span></text><text for="L9"><span begin="36.984" end="37.284">Tya</span><span begin="37.284" end="37.636">nyt</span><span begin="37.636" end="37.944">sya</span><span begin="37.944" end="38.274">go</span><span begin="38.274" end="38.612">dy`</span><span begin="38.612" end="38.986">mo</span><span begin="38.986" end="39.668">i</span><span begin="39.668" end="40.028">bes</span><span begin="40.028" end="40.352">cel&apos;</span><span begin="40.352" end="40.622">no</span></text><text for="L10"><span begin="40.712" end="41.026">V nix</span><span begin="41.026" end="41.678">bol&apos;</span><span begin="41.678" end="42.062">she</span><span begin="42.062" end="42.722">net</span><span begin="42.722" end="43.044">lyub</span><span begin="43.044" end="44.248">vi</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>项柳</songwriter><songwriter>項柳</songwriter><songwriter>Hsiang Liu</songwriter><songwriter>Anastasiia Tolshchina</songwriter><songwriter>尤裴佳</songwriter><songwriter>Peijia You</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="44.248"><div begin="4.305" end="44.248"><p begin="4.305" end="8.033" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4.305" end="4.575">Я</span> <span begin="4.575" end="4.889">вас</span> <span begin="4.889" end="5.243">лю</span><span begin="5.243" end="5.573">би</span><span begin="5.573" end="5.925">ла,</span> <span begin="5.925" end="6.279">лю</span><span begin="6.279" end="6.899">бовь</span> <span begin="6.899" end="7.289">мо</span><span begin="7.289" end="8.033">я</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经爱过你</span></p><p begin="8.347" end="12.059" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.347" end="8.639">В серд</span><span begin="8.639" end="8.977">це</span> <span begin="8.977" end="9.323">мо</span><span begin="9.323" end="9.667">ём</span> <span begin="9.667" end="9.997">до</span> <span begin="9.997" end="10.349">сих</span> <span begin="10.349" end="10.987">пор</span> <span begin="10.987" end="11.355">жи</span><span begin="11.355" end="12.059">ва</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也许爱在我心中还没有完全消亡</span></p><p begin="12.435" end="16.155" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.435" end="12.705">Так</span> <span begin="12.705" end="13.027">без</span><span begin="13.027" end="13.395">на</span><span begin="13.395" end="13.725">дёж</span><span begin="13.725" end="14.063">но</span> <span begin="14.063" end="14.437">и</span> <span begin="14.437" end="15.045">ис</span><span begin="15.045" end="15.427">крен</span><span begin="15.427" end="16.155">но</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经那样爱过你，真诚而无望</span></p><p begin="16.576" end="20.206" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.576" end="17.206">Неж</span><span begin="17.206" end="17.528">но</span> <span begin="17.528" end="17.828">и</span> <span begin="17.828" end="18.158">так</span> <span begin="18.158" end="18.504">та</span><span begin="18.504" end="19.142">ин</span><span begin="19.142" end="19.532">ствен</span><span begin="19.532" end="20.206">но</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经那样爱过你，温柔而迷茫</span></p><p begin="20.588" end="24.368" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.588" end="20.918">Го</span><span begin="20.918" end="21.218">лос,</span> <span begin="21.218" end="21.572">что</span> <span begin="21.572" end="21.946">мне</span> <span begin="21.946" end="22.262">при</span><span begin="22.262" end="22.628">хо</span><span begin="22.628" end="23.266">дил</span> <span begin="23.266" end="23.618">во</span> <span begin="23.618" end="24.368">сне</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个曾在梦中走向我的声音</span></p><p begin="24.714" end="28.478" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.714" end="24.998">Стал</span> <span begin="24.998" end="25.352">рас</span><span begin="25.352" end="25.696">тво</span><span begin="25.696" end="26.026">рять</span><span begin="26.026" end="26.334">ся</span> <span begin="26.334" end="26.724">в без</span><span begin="26.724" end="27.354">дон</span><span begin="27.354" end="27.698">ной</span> <span begin="27.698" end="28.478">тьме</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已渐渐消融在无尽的幽暗里</span></p><p begin="28.786" end="32.522" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.786" end="29.072">По</span><span begin="29.072" end="29.402">то</span><span begin="29.402" end="29.762">ки</span> <span begin="29.762" end="30.084">буд</span><span begin="30.084" end="30.436">нич</span><span begin="30.436" end="30.788">ной</span> <span begin="30.788" end="31.442">су</span><span begin="31.442" end="31.772">е</span><span begin="31.772" end="32.522">ты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">平日琐碎喧嚣的洪流</span></p><p begin="32.904" end="36.602" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.904" end="33.174">У</span><span begin="33.174" end="33.496">нес</span><span begin="33.496" end="33.864">ли</span> <span begin="33.864" end="34.194">ми</span><span begin="34.194" end="34.538">лы</span><span begin="34.538" end="34.928">е</span> <span begin="34.928" end="35.574">мне</span> <span begin="35.574" end="35.912">чер</span><span begin="35.912" end="36.602">ты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带走了我眷恋的容颜</span></p><p begin="36.984" end="40.622" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.984" end="37.284">Тя</span><span begin="37.284" end="37.636">нут</span><span begin="37.636" end="37.944">ся</span> <span begin="37.944" end="38.274">го</span><span begin="38.274" end="38.612">ды</span> <span begin="38.612" end="38.986">мо</span><span begin="38.986" end="39.668">и</span> <span begin="39.668" end="40.028">бес</span><span begin="40.028" end="40.352">цель</span><span begin="40.352" end="40.622">но</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫漫岁月拖延着消逝</span></p><p begin="40.712" end="44.248" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.712" end="41.026">В них</span> <span begin="41.026" end="41.678">боль</span><span begin="41.678" end="42.062">ше</span> <span begin="42.062" end="42.722">нет</span> <span begin="42.722" end="43.044">люб</span><span begin="43.044" end="44.248">ви</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样，再也没有爱</span></p></div></body></tt>